Revision history for App-FileSync

0.001.1

        - Build: test on Windows with Perl 5.42 again.  Its B::Hooks::EndOfScope
          faults at exit, so the plain-Perl hook is used there.
        - filesync, filesync-server and filesync-admin select that hook for
          themselves on 5.42 for Windows, so it no longer has to be set to run
          them; an implementation already in the environment is left alone.
          The CI test step no longer sets it, and so exercises the choice.

